WEBVTT

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:29.070
Become a prostitute, Makie...

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:42.250
You would be better off than becoming a swordsman.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.350
Everyone's left.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:05.560
Mom told me not to run since I have asthma.

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:08.610
-I see.
-Oh, a hairpin.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.320
How pretty.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.860
This is

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.870
something my mother gave me long ago.

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:28.540
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:30.960
One, two, three

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.260
Undead tree

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.680
What truth

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:41.350
I'll come true

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:48.520
Wow...

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:52.400
I see that bright light

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:58.780
This is all I have

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:03.290
What did you say?
I know

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:07.830
Why do you say?

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:13.500
Hone the blade lie around

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:20.220
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:24.560
I got lost
I was lost

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:28.310
Survive of vision

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.610
Unfinished heaven

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:35.360
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:39.110
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:43.910
Survive of vision

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:55.050
Mr. Manji, I'm going to get change.
We're out of small coins.

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:56.170
Sure.

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.220
I'll be right back, wait for me.

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.760
And where should I wait--?

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.310
Goodness.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.560
That idiot.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.150
You look bored, mister.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:25.160
Why is a woman with looks like yours
taking customers?

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:26.910
It's a long story.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:48.310
It's for self-defense.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.770
I'm all on my own after all.

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:58.280
This is a nasty one.
You plan on killing some bears?

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.570
Who hired you?

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:06.330
I... I don't know his name. He's a young samurai.

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.700
With slanted eyes and long hair.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:12.540
Come to think of it, I've never even seen
Anotsu's face.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.050
Please forgive me. I was given 20 ryo.

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:21.220
If you're saying that's more important
than your life, do as you like.

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:39.530
My name is Makie Otonotachibana.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:45.530
A swordfighter acting in accordance with my oath
to the leader of the Itto-ryu, Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:49.280
I see. Thanks for the introduction.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.330
Come.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.410
Prepare yourself.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:25.110
Someone who can only fight like that
shouldn't be swinging a blade around a full-fledged man.

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:30.080
Is the Itto-ryu scraping the bottom
of the barrel already?

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:35.710
Are you okay?

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.330
You were watching?

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.920
So you were a swordsman?

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:49.680
-Want it?
-What?

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.050
Brilliant!

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.430
I'm unworthy of your praise.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.720
Unworthy, you say?

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:37.980
It's rare someone your age is able to
impart such emotion.

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:40.150
Miss Maki, was it?

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.440
You're one heck of a woman.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:43.770
Especially in the way

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:48.240
you portray expression of
the beauty of form in such elegant phrases.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:51.870
Well, I must say you're quite poetic yourself.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:54.160
Serve him a drink, Miss Maki.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:07.090
I believe I recall seeing you somewhere.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.970
That's right.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:13.550
There was a woman who looked exactly like you
in the tiny red-light district of Monzen-Nakacho.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:16.140
In fact, I'm certain.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.680
I can never forget a woman I've slept with.

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:22.190
-How about it? Tonight, for old time's--
-Sir.

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:25.770
Please restrain yourself from going any further.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:31.780
We are but humble geisha.
If you desire the spring, the night has yet to come.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:34.450
You're welcome to try Asakusa or Fukagawa.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.870
-Ms. Hatsu, thank you for what you did.
-It's nothing.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:47.380
Your songs, they...

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.510
resonate well with me.

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:55.180
I too sold my body near Asakusa before ending up here.

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:56.890
Just like you.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:02.980
Once, I tried fleeing the district with a man
I was fond of.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.150
I got caught, of course.

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:08.070
The man really got the worst of it though.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.860
He hung himself.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:14.660
The one time I want to try
and live an upstanding life...

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:20.910
The sun must have taken notice,
and snatched such dreams away from me.

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.420
Are you jealous?

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:33.550
It's getting hot...

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.690
Do you think the reason

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:48.400
I bought your freedom
was so you could be a geisha in a place like that?

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.190
I was trying to repay you.

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.740
I don't recall asking for such a service!

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.860
Apologies.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:59.830
I heard you fought with the man in question
yesterday.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:03.500
The one who took out Sabato Kuroi
and Taito Magatsu.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.620
But if it's you...

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:08.420
I will return the favor as quickly as I can.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.300
But once this is over, I...

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:16.430
Someday I would have you become mine.

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:22.600
If I were ignorant,

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:26.270
I wonder just how blessed I would feel right now.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.480
I know everything.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:36.910
You just want me for my strength and that only.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:40.910
In your eyes, a life like mine is...
But I--

00:09:57.130 --> 00:10:01.310
Why didn't you embrace me back then?

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:06.060
If I'd descended into the realm of beasts
by your hand,

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:10.560
I'd have instantly found the resolve
to live as a prostitute.

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:16.150
I couldn't bear to see your talent
buried in such a way.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.360
That's all.

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:24.750
The place you worked was
The Fujiwara Garden in Monzen-Nakacho, right?

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:27.160
The owner asked for a favor.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.710
He said,
"She may have paid the 50 ryo for freedom,

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:33.090
but my shop won't hold up having lost its star.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:36.760
I want you to bring her back, even if you
have to use force."

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:40.470
What a selfish old man. Right?

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:43.350
Well, make sure you only hit with
the back of your swords.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:46.980
Once she's out cold,
the spoils of battle will be ours.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.440
It's because I was a child, wasn't it?

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.810
I understand.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:01.240
-I've just now comprehended it.
-You fool! If you cut that off

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.410
no one will want to buy you!

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:25.180
It's my final act of selfishness.

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:34.310
Okay, Mr. Manji, let's start from the place
we discussed.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:35.730
Yeah.

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:36.820
Oh, my.

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:41.610
What do you mean, "Oh, my"?
You were waiting for us, right?

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:45.330
Sorry about not finishing up before.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:48.660
So, you're saying you'll make up for it?

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:52.040
I'm not sure what you could've improved on, but...

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.960
Go into that dessert shop for a while, would you?

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.600
Mr. Manji.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.520
-Yes?
-Your hand.

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:13.270
If you'll be carelessly spending,

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:16.110
-don't think I won't do the same!
-Oh, is that so?

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.110
-I'm off.
-Right.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.780
I'll be back in a half hour, don't wander off.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.410
What was that?

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:28.740
You should have told her the truth.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:31.460
She would have stepped in, weak as she is.

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.330
She'd just get in the way.

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.000
You're a bit different than before.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.420
-My hair?
-Your eyes.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:48.390
Once I've returned from dealing with that man,

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:54.270
please consider that as my resolve
to be your co-conspirator for the rest of my life.

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:56.730
And if you don't succeed?

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:05.700
It's true what you say, miss,
but I feel bad for your boyfriend all the same.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.030
Excuse me, one more sweet bean pudding!

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.830
Okay, I get it. Just leave it at that, huh?

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.120
All right, all right, sorry.
I'll keep my opinions to myself.

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.960
But you know...

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:20.840
There are two places on a man's body
that do the thinking.

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:25.760
Whether he's married or whatever,
sometimes the lower head tells us,

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:28.970
"I just want to sleep with a woman,
consequences be darned."

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:32.890
It's our nature. Our nature, I tell you.

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:35.100
But boy, your man sure got guts.

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:38.100
Picking up a hooker that early in the morning?

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:41.110
Yes... there's something off-putting about that...

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:43.690
For a prostitute, that woman...

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:46.610
What is it?

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:48.160
I'm just restless.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.620
-Sure it's not just heartburn?
-Sorry!

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.200
I'll leave the payment here.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:55.540
Come now, it can be my treat.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:59.630
You ate so much. If you don't rest up,
it could be trouble.

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:02.000
How about you use my room?

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:03.170
How about it?

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:09.720
Hey! See, what did I say? In the bucket, girl! The bucket!

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:13.160
Good grief. To think I lectured a woman like that.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:15.290
If I mess this up...

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:22.080
It's basically a sneak attack, but we'll call it even.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:27.840
Where did...?

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.620
What's wrong?

00:15:56.700 --> 00:16:00.210
If you don't hurry up, I'll pull it right out.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:03.330
I'm sorry for doing something so horrible.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.170
No need for that.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:10.840
My body doesn't really like to die.

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:16.260
There is a way. Decapitate me.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:18.350
Something like this...

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:24.850
shouldn't be a problem at all for you.

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:32.530
Before meeting you, I killed three men.

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:37.450
I killed people, yet felt nothing.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:44.790
When I start to doubt whether
that man's ideals are correct or not...

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.090
I become unable to wield my sword.

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:54.090
Whether your master is
some ally of justice or whatever,

00:16:55.840 --> 00:17:00.810
you yourself had some reason
to not throw away your sword.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:04.020
Remember that, and fight for it.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:08.230
If you don't want to,
it'd be best for you to return to the whore house.

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:14.400
Become a prostitute, Makie...

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:17.700
You would be better off, than becoming a swordsman.

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:18.910
I...

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:25.750
All this reminiscing caused my leg to reattach.

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:29.840
You still intend to fight with your body like that?

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:34.920
I've never lost a fight
after picking up my sword.

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:38.760
Not once!
I'm kidding, of course.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:43.350
But I can't stand being given a break
and left half-dead.

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:48.480
I want to say something like, "It's time to
get serious now," and act tough,

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.820
but, sadly, I was serious the whole time.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:55.530
So I'm going to come at you
until there's nothing left to regret!

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:28.190
Alrighty then.

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:30.650
Now I'm ready.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:36.400
Seventy percent of my weapons, one arm.

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:38.820
I'm much lighter than before.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:44.450
Let's settle this with the next strike.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.500
Yes.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:13.980
Miss...

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:18.360
Give me a requiem, would you?

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:23.910
I don't want to shame myself any further.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:37.260
Stupid girl!

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:41.050
What good will it do for you to draw a sword?

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:47.430
Ms. Rin, right?

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:50.600
Kagehisa told me about--

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:52.810
Kagehisa Anotsu told me about you.

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:55.520
Let me ask one thing.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:57.530
How many people have died

00:19:57.610 --> 00:20:00.190
for the sake of your revenge until now?

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:03.450
However many it is,

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:06.030
by the time you get to Kagehisa Anotsu,

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:09.250
it will be many times more.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.000
Have you ever thought about

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:15.710
whether it is right to take lives for one's own
personal grudge?

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:19.880
I swore it in front of my parents' graves.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:22.050
I will have my revenge.

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:25.300
And I will do any number of vile things to have it.

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:29.770
I don't think it's right to kill people.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:35.270
But... I think dirtying my hands for my own blood
relatives is much more human

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:41.690
than becoming cruel only to prove one's
own duty and justification.

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:48.240
Could I be wrong?

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:55.540
Thank you. That's all I wanted to hear.

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.420
Protect that girl for the rest of your life.

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:03.930
Another shame cast upon me, I see.

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:12.230
I'm going back to the red-light district.

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:15.100
My idiot father hasn't learned his lesson
from gambling.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:16.400
Not an uncommon story.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:21.190
No matter how far I go, I'm just a caged bird.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.990
But for you at least...

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:28.450
My mother was a prostitute her whole life as well.

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:31.490
Her family's samurai background didn't matter.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:34.960
But now I'm truly proud of it.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:38.000
Makie...

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:42.590
Compared to a swordsman who hurts people,

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:46.880
my mother, who always comforted others,
deserves much praise.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:48.590
You...

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:51.390
I can no longer turn back.

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:52.850
But, you...

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:07.660
Hey, quit moving! Has your arm reattached yet?

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:11.330
I lose to a woman, then get saved by another.

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:15.410
Mr. Manji...
No matter how confident you get being immortal,

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.130
it looks like if I'm not with you for the
crucial moment, you're done for.

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:22.130
If you learn anything from this...

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:25.550
you won't lie like you did today ever again.

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:27.300
By the way, you...

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:30.340
smell like vomit.

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:39.100
-Your companion left you this.
-When?

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:40.400
Just now.

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:54.800
ACT THREE – DREAM PANGS
